  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Handicap International Federation (HI), Inclusive Education in Mali, Niger and Burkina Faso</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project seeks to support children with disabilities as well as other marginalized children, including refugee children and internally displaced children, their families, communities, school stakeholders, education authorities, and civil society organizations to successfully welcome and include marginalized children into mainstream schools in Mali, Niger, and Burkina Faso.</narrative>
  </description>
